  "details": "# Issue: \n\nClicking on the Group Queue timer in the Quick Menu cycles through 3 different modes of what is being displayed. First: time you have been in the queue, second: your place in the queue and third: none (nothing is being shown).  \n\nThe problem is however that there are no tool tips to in form you about this. I found out about this by accident for example.\n\n# Expected Behavior:\n\nThere should be tooltips for each mode. It could look something like this:\n\n1. Time you have been in the queue for. Click to see your place in the queue.\n\n2. Place in queue / how many people are in the queue. Click to hide.\n\n3. Information is currently hidden, click to see how long you have been in the queue for.",
